cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PromptPolygraph in your work, please cite it."
title: PromptPolygraph
abstract: >-
  A local-first, cloud-agnostic harness for evaluating and red-teaming web/API/LLM
  systems: synthetic-prompt generation, rubric + assertion scoring with a
  multi-judge ensemble, a persona reaction panel, a forensic audit, an
  OWASP/MITRE-ATLAS-mapped red-team engine, and a validation/trust layer
  (provenance, calibration, statistical rigor, signing, reproducibility).
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/justinkastil/promptpolygraph"
url: "https://github.com/justinkastil/promptpolygraph"
keywords:
  - llm
  - evaluation
  - red-teaming
  - testing
  - prompt
authors:
  - name: PromptPolygraph contributors
